OL,3,AIt's A Sin star 'keeps you guessing' in
OL,4,AWales-set thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott Howells plays the role of Cai,
OL,7,Fwho runs the website but denies posting
OL,8,Fthe listing, describing the character
OL,9,Fas "charming, complicated and never
OL,10,Fquite what he seems".
